      "limitHint": "Preserve meaning; do not truncate."
    },
    {
      "key": "components.onboardingtourv3.0b3cb95bce97",
      "source": "大时间与一级功能区是骨架；其余组件随你摆。",
      "kind": "text",
      "parameters": [],
      "locations": [
        {
          "file": "apps/desktop/src/components/OnboardingTourV3.tsx",
          "line": 74,
          "context": "return i18n(\"components.onboardingtourv3.0b3cb95bce97\");"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "The large clock and main features form the skeleton; the rest of the widgets are yours to arrange.",
      "status": "prefilled-review",
      "limitHint": "Preserve meaning; do not truncate."
    },
    {
      "key": "components.onboardingtourv3.0ca382e2edca",
      "source": "底栏常驻：左「标签页」，中「搜索或问小OH」，右「OneGO!」。",
      "kind": "text",
      "parameters": [],
      "locations": [
        {
          "file": "apps/desktop/src/components/OnboardingTourV3.tsx",
          "line": 81
        }
      ],
      "translation": "The bottom bar stays put: “Tabs” on the left, “Search or ask Little OH” in the middle, “OneGO!” on the right.",
      "status": "prefilled-review",
      "limitHint": "Preserve meaning; do not truncate."
    },
    {
      "key": "components.onboardingtourv3.16db14984ce5",
      "source": "右键标签可复制、关闭，或一星收进 OnePage。",
      "kind": "text",
      "parameters": [],
      "locations": [
        {
          "file": "apps/desktop/src/components/OnboardingTourV3.tsx",
          "line": 70
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Right-click a tab to copy, close it, or one-star it into OnePage.",
      "status": "prefilled-review",
      "limitHint": "Preserve meaning; do not truncate."
    },
    {
      "key": "components.onboardingtourv3.1878863a8e7b",
      "source": "双击空白就地建便笺；画笔恒在最高层，可撤销清空。",
      "kind": "text",
      "parameters": [],
      "locations": [
